WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.387
Use these tasks to practice the patterns rather than copy a finished solution.

00:00:05.387 --> 00:00:13.247
Start with a simple threshold check, then build a two-way decision, then a short range loop.

00:00:13.247 --> 00:00:20.206
After that, count how many values exceed ten and classify values into low, medium, or high categories.

00:00:20.834 --> 00:00:27.531
For the final question, explain in your own words when a while loop makes more sense than a for loop.

00:00:27.531 --> 00:00:34.730
If you can explain the decision clearly, you are understanding the concept rather than memorizing syntax.
